    'rules.title': 'Game rules',
    'rules.1': 'Each room supports up to 8 players; at least 3 are needed to start the match. Mid-game it can go on with 2; if a single player remains, the room closes immediately and nobody keeps the points.',
    'rules.2': 'The number of rounds (1 to 5) and the drawing time (30 to 120 seconds) are chosen by whoever creates the room.',
    'rules.3': 'The waiting room lasts at most 5 minutes: if the match does not start in that time, the room closes.',
    'rules.4': 'In each round, every player draws once, in a fixed order.',
    'rules.5': "When it's your turn to draw, you choose 1 of 3 suggested words — and you cannot write in the chat while drawing.",
    'rules.6': 'The other players guess by writing in the room chat: the server compares each message with the secret word.',
    'rules.7': 'Guessers earn more points the faster they get it right (gold trophy for 1st, silver for 2nd, bronze after that); each player only scores once per word.',
    'rules.8': 'The drawer earns points for every player who guesses right; if everyone guesses, the round ends immediately.',
    'rules.9': 'Cheating or bad behaviour: any player can report another — a vote opens on everyone\'s screen and, with more than 50% of the votes (minimum 2), the reported player is expelled and loses their points.',
    'rules.10': 'If you leave the match you lose all your points and cannot return; if you disconnect by accident, your seat is held for 15 seconds.',
    'rules.11': 'Words appear in the room language (PT, EN or ES), chosen when the room is created.',
    'rules.12': "The room chat is not saved — it's only for the session's conversation and guesses.",
    'legal.kicker': 'Rabisco PRTC, Ltd. — fictional company, academic project',
    'privacy.title': 'Privacy Policy',
    'privacy.s1.title': '1. Data controller', 'privacy.s1.text': 'Rabisco PRTC, Ltd. (a fictional company, within the 42 Porto ft_transcendence academic project) is the controller of your personal data. Privacy contact: privacidade@rabisco.example.',
    'privacy.s2.title': '2. Data we process', 'privacy.s2.text': 'Account data: username, email, encrypted password, avatar and language; if you sign in with 42, also your 42 account identifier. Game data: points, wins, matches, history, friends list and reports made in rooms. Technical data: the session cookie. Room drawings and chat are not stored.',
    'privacy.s3.title': '3. Purposes and legal basis', 'privacy.s3.text': 'We process data to create and authenticate your account, run the game (rooms, scoreboards, rankings, friends) and moderate behaviour (reports). The legal basis is the performance of the service you request (art. 6(1)(b) GDPR) and our legitimate interest in keeping the platform safe (art. 6(1)(f)). We do no profiling or automated decision-making.',
    'privacy.s4.title': '4. Cookies', 'privacy.s4.text': 'We use only the essential login session cookie, strictly necessary for the platform to work. No advertising, analytics or third-party cookies.',
    'privacy.s5.title': '5. Data sharing', 'privacy.s5.text': 'We do not sell or hand over personal data to third parties. If you use the 42 login, we receive from 42 only the minimum needed (identifier, name and email) and we never post anything to your 42 account.',
    'privacy.s6.title': '6. Data retention', 'privacy.s6.text': 'We keep your data only while your account exists. Deleting the account permanently removes all associated data. Drawings and chat are never stored in the first place.',
    'privacy.s7.title': '7. Your rights (GDPR)', 'privacy.s7.text': 'You have the rights of access, rectification, erasure ("right to be forgotten"), restriction of processing, portability and objection. You can exercise them directly in your profile (edit or delete the account) or via the contact email. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority — in Portugal, the CNPD (cnpd.pt).',
    'privacy.s8.title': '8. Security', 'privacy.s8.text': 'Passwords are stored hashed and salted (never in plain text), connections use HTTPS, and access to data is limited to what is strictly necessary.',
    'privacy.s9.title': '9. Changes to this policy', 'privacy.s9.text': 'If this policy changes, we will announce it on the platform. Version of 16 September 2026.',
    'terms.title': 'Terms of Service',
    'terms.s1.title': '1. Acceptance of terms', 'terms.s1.text': 'By creating an account, you accept these terms of use for the platform.',
    'terms.s2.title': '2. User account', 'terms.s2.text': 'You are responsible for keeping your password confidential.',
    'terms.s3.title': '3. What we store', 'terms.s3.text': 'We keep only what the platform needs to work: username, email, encrypted password, avatar, language, game statistics (points, wins, matches), match history, friends list and reports made in rooms. Room drawings and chat are not stored.',
    'terms.s4.title': '4. Platform conduct', 'terms.s4.text': 'Offensive drawings and messages can be reported by any player: the report opens a vote in the room and, with more than 50% of the votes, the player is expelled and loses the match points.',
    'terms.s5.title': '5. Content ownership', 'terms.s5.text': 'Drawings created in a room are temporary and are not stored after the match ends.',
    'terms.s6.title': '6. Limitation of liability', 'terms.s6.text': 'The platform is provided "as is", as part of an academic project.',
    'terms.s7.title': '7. Account suspension and deletion', 'terms.s7.text': 'The user can delete their account at any time (data removal is permanent). Rabisco PRTC, Ltd. reserves the right to suspend accounts that violate these terms.',
    'terms.s8.title': '8. Changes and contact', 'terms.s8.text': 'These terms may be updated; relevant changes will be communicated on the platform. Questions: suporte@rabisco.example.',
    'footer.copyright': '© 2026 Rabisco PRTC, Ltd. — fictional company, academic project',
